 THESAURUSORGNAME   NASA Goddard Space Flight Center
                    Solid Earth > Geodetics/Gravity > Polar Motion,
                    Solid Earth > Geodetics/Gravity > Reference Systems,
                    Solid Earth > Geodetics/Gravity > Rotational Variations,
                    VLBI > Very Long Baseline Interferometry
 FEES               None
 USECONSTRAINTS     restricted
 USELIMITATION      * if this normal equation shall be used to compute a
                      VLBI-only single session solution, not all parameters set
                      up in this normal equation can be estimated:
                      + to estimate station positions a datum has to be added
                      (e.g., NNR+NNT datum)
